  "interpretation": [
    "Four MX48 and four MX46 ears, one at each front half-band end. Front steel rivets:8/MX48 and6/MX46,56 total.",
    "Eight M336 pins each have one quarter-inch x1-1/2 split pin, distinct from the two-cotter M339 rear suspension pivots.",
    "M333 screw attaches to upper ear; M330 lever attaches to lower ear and carries M331 swivel, M332 nut and M335 spring. Four each.",
    "Original HB207 prints M335 for screw and spring. HB101/102/134/135 and SNL identify the screw as M333; definitions remain separate.",
    "Paired front lugs, common pin width, swivel section, spring dimensions and nominal thread surfaces are reconstruction hypotheses. Later SNL fittings do not replace the selected segmented lining variant.",
    "First three copper lining rivets in each half lie under the front foot and need the longer source-listed stock; do not bury old upset heads.",
    "M343/MX88 stops and their supporting bars require a subsequent coupled mounting check. Front control-rod attachment is an open interface."
  ],
